180
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">Stop right there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Stop!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Don't follow him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

182
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">Please, I'm scared.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,600
<font color="#ffffff">Don't leave me alone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">Are you hurt?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">Just a little.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,800
<font color="#ffffff">Everything went as planned, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:39,720
<font color="#ffffff">Good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:42,960
<font color="#ffffff">Keep an eye on them.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'll contact you again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

189
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">Since we've already found Chan,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">why don't we just ask about the diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

190
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:04,480
<font color="#ffffff">And when we caught him before,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:06,080
<font color="#ffffff">did we find the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:16,720
<font color="#ffffff">Where is the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">Diamond again? What diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">My diamond you stole</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">before fleeing the police.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

195
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:27,520
<font color="#ffffff">Fleeing? I know nothing!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">Are you crazy?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">You don't know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:55,680
<font color="#ffffff">How did he know I was here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">Did he follow me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:01,000
<font color="#ffffff">They didn't follow you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:10,800
<font color="#ffffff">They've been coming here</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to harass me all the time anyway.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

202
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:17,120
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:23,280
<font color="#ffffff">You'd better not know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,440
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want you feeling guilty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:32,200
<font color="#ffffff">So I am involved in this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:40,840
<font color="#ffffff">Please tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,160
<font color="#ffffff">Please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">Welcome.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">Are you interested in any colors?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:01,680
<font color="#ffffff">-This color suits you--</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

212
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">Stop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:08,080
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,480
<font color="#ffffff">Forgot me already?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">You were the one who brought Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to work for my dad!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

218
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:20,840
<font color="#ffffff">Did you forget?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:24,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you Kamnan Sawaeng's son?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">Bingo!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:21:28,040 --> 00:21:30,120
<font color="#ffffff">You have a good memory.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:21:34,560 --> 00:21:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">Now tell me where Chansuek is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:39,760
<font color="#ffffff">Back off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:44,200
<font color="#ffffff">How should I know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not saying it again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">Spill it, or someone gets hurt.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:51,640
<font color="#ffffff">How about that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:56,320
<font color="#ffffff">I said I don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:58,800
<font color="#ffffff">You don't?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:22:01,520 --> 00:22:03,560
<font color="#ffffff">Trash the place!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">Stop! Tell them to stop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">Or I'll call the cops</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and have you locked up!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

234
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:14,600
<font color="#ffffff">Go ahead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

235
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Call them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:22:18,120 --> 00:22:19,560
<font color="#ffffff">Trash it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">Are you deaf?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">I said stop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:26,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'll ask you one last time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:22:27,560 --> 00:22:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me where Chan is!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:22:34,040 --> 00:22:35,160
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:22:35,840 --> 00:22:39,320
<font color="#ffffff">Why don't you ask your dad, you dumbass?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:44,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:22:49,840 --> 00:22:51,280
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:22:52,520 --> 00:22:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">Mind your own business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,040
<font color="#ffffff">Reporter!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:11,680
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

250
00:24:21,280 --> 00:24:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">Boss, reporters!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:28,640
<font color="#ffffff">Let's get out of here</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:30,600
<font color="#ffffff">before they take photos.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:50,200
<font color="#ffffff">This isn't over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:51,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:25:16,040 --> 00:25:16,960
<font color="#ffffff">Darat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:19,200
<font color="#ffffff">Please tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:25:19,280 --> 00:25:20,520
<font color="#ffffff">Please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:25:27,280 --> 00:25:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">After you disappeared,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:25:29,760 --> 00:25:32,640
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng’s men kept harassing me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:35,480
<font color="#ffffff">They claimed</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:25:35,560 --> 00:25:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">I brought a mole into their camp</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:42,320
<font color="#ffffff">and that I was your accomplice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:47,880
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">So I'm the reason you were in danger.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:25:57,440 --> 00:25:58,960
<font color="#ffffff">Don't blame yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">It was your duty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:26:05,520 --> 00:26:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">You weren't doing it for yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:26:09,840 --> 00:26:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">I told you, it's not your fault.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:26:22,040 --> 00:26:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you tell me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">how much you had suffered?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

272
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:30,760
<font color="#ffffff">Because I didn't want to see you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">feeling guilty like this.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

273
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:37,880
<font color="#ffffff">Now that they are in Bangkok,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:40,480
<font color="#ffffff">you aren't safe here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:26:42,760 --> 00:26:44,720
<font color="#ffffff">I guess so.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,400
<font color="#ffffff">I'm scared, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be afraid.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:27:16,320 --> 00:27:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">I won't let them touch you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:27:33,360 --> 00:27:37,040
<font color="#ffffff">You're right that Chan won't talk,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:40,080
<font color="#ffffff">but can we really trust that woman?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:27:47,520 --> 00:27:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">You still have the nerve to call me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:55,080
<font color="#ffffff">Why shouldn't I?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:58,520
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you want to know about the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,640
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:28:05,800 --> 00:28:09,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'm saying I can help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">But there's a catch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,600
<font color="#ffffff">A catch?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:16,240
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">You have to help me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">regain Chansuek's trust first.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

290
00:28:22,600 --> 00:28:25,400
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, is he with you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,120
<font color="#ffffff">No,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:28:27,840 --> 00:28:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">but I can reach him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:28:32,120 --> 00:28:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">Where is he? Tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:37,200
<font color="#ffffff">Knowing where he is</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">won't do you any good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:28:40,520 --> 00:28:42,320
<font color="#ffffff">He has amnesia.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:46,120
<font color="#ffffff">What? Is that true?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:51,360
<font color="#ffffff">You've caught him so many times,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">and what did you get out of it</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:28:54,080 --> 00:28:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">besides one run of bad luck</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:28:56,320 --> 00:28:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">after another?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">Don't rub it in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:29:02,840 --> 00:29:05,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'm angry enough as it is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:08,280
<font color="#ffffff">More importantly,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon has already reached Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:29:16,800 --> 00:29:19,800
<font color="#ffffff">You were targeted</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">by Deputy Papon yourself.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

308
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:23,960
<font color="#ffffff">Keep messing with Chansuek,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and it'll backfire on you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

309
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,800
<font color="#ffffff">That damn Deputy Papon</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:29,360
<font color="#ffffff">is like a plague</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that keeps clinging to me!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

311
00:29:31,040 --> 00:29:32,680
<font color="#ffffff">But I can help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">How can I trust you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:29:37,080 --> 00:29:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">when you tricked me once before?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:29:39,840 --> 00:29:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">Last time,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:43,680
<font color="#ffffff">I was forced by Deputy Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:29:43,760 --> 00:29:46,200
<font color="#ffffff">But I won't trick you this time</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:29:46,280 --> 00:29:48,960
<font color="#ffffff">because I need your help too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:51,480
<font color="#ffffff">I want to get away from Paul.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:29:58,520 --> 00:30:00,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'll trust you one last time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:03,160
<font color="#ffffff">Remember, this is your final chance.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:07,680
<font color="#ffffff">Great.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:30:07,760 --> 00:30:09,960
<font color="#ffffff">Then do as I say.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:30:10,040 --> 00:30:14,520
<font color="#ffffff">Once Chansuek gets his memory back</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and reveals the diamond's location,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

325
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:17,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'll let you know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:22,480
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:30:22,560 --> 00:30:24,840
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me the plan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">I never trusted that bitch Darat,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">but she has a point.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:30:37,520 --> 00:30:40,560
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon is protecting</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek right now.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

331
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:44,760
<font color="#ffffff">If we act recklessly like before,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:30:45,280 --> 00:30:47,600
<font color="#ffffff">we'll just get burned again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:30:47,680 --> 00:30:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">If Deputy Papon managed</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to win Chansuek over,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

334
00:30:51,120 --> 00:30:53,520
<font color="#ffffff">why doesn't he have the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:30:53,600 --> 00:30:55,600
<font color="#ffffff">Because Chansuek's amnesia</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:57,160
<font color="#ffffff">might be real.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:30:57,880 --> 00:31:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">Then capturing Chansuek ourselves</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:02,880
<font color="#ffffff">will not do us any good either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:04,600
<font color="#ffffff">That's why</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:06,560
<font color="#ffffff">we have to use Darat for now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:31:08,520 --> 00:31:09,720
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">Either way,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:15,760
<font color="#ffffff">gather our best men and send them</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to Bangkok immediately.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

344
00:31:15,840 --> 00:31:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">Lek alone can't handle this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">Got it, Dad. I'll take care of it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:35,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:31:37,080 --> 00:31:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:31:39,360 --> 00:31:41,080
<font color="#ffffff">I understand.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:45,400
<font color="#ffffff">Take care of yourself, all right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry about us over here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:31:48,760 --> 00:31:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:31:52,520 --> 00:31:56,320
<font color="#ffffff">What did Junior say, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:59,840
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod called to say</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">Darat isn't feeling well,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">so he's staying to take care of her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:08,920
<font color="#ffffff">Then she should go see a doctor.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He's no doctor.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

357
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:10,560
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">Why stay and nurse her?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:32:13,120 --> 00:32:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">Come on now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:32:14,840 --> 00:32:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">That's his business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">He's useless.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:32:21,160 --> 00:32:24,480
<font color="#ffffff">He's playing with fire. I'm telling Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:30,240
<font color="#ffffff">What are you blabbering about, Tofu?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:32:30,320 --> 00:32:34,280
<font color="#ffffff">Get your idioms straight.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Is it "fire," or "field"?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

365
00:32:34,360 --> 00:32:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">Playing with fire, or playing the field?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:40,920
<font color="#ffffff">Same difference.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:45,280
<font color="#ffffff">The bottom line is,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">he is indecisive and two-timing her.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

368
00:32:45,360 --> 00:32:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">He's totally useless.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:32:49,920 --> 00:32:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, leave it be.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:56,760
<font color="#ffffff">That's adult business,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">not for kids to mess with.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

371
00:32:59,280 --> 00:33:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">CHATCHAWAN</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">PRIVATE DETECTIVE AGENCY<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

372
00:33:16,080 --> 00:33:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for saving me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:33:23,280 --> 00:33:24,520
<font color="#ffffff">And…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:33:24,600 --> 00:33:28,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry for lying to you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:33:29,760 --> 00:33:32,360
<font color="#ffffff">I know it's not fair to you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:35,520
<font color="#ffffff">but I want to tell you…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:44,680
<font color="#ffffff">You were only doing your job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,680
<font color="#ffffff">You…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:33:52,080 --> 00:33:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">I've thought about it a lot.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:55,760
<font color="#ffffff">I was once a cop myself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,440
<font color="#ffffff">When I was on a secret mission,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:33:58,520 --> 00:34:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">I couldn't even tell my family.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">I understand you're bound</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">by your professional ethics.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

385
00:34:44,600 --> 00:34:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">Are you calling him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">Just call if you want to.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:52,760
<font color="#ffffff">What, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:55,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not calling anyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:34:55,520 --> 00:34:56,920
<font color="#ffffff">Don't lie to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

390
00:34:58,600 --> 00:35:00,520
<font color="#ffffff">Ever since you got back,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:35:02,200 --> 00:35:04,320
<font color="#ffffff">you've been staring at that phone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:35:05,600 --> 00:35:07,880
<font color="#ffffff">Wow, good observation.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:10,360
<font color="#ffffff">If he isn't calling,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:35:11,120 --> 00:35:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">call him yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">What are you waiting for?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:36:21,560 --> 00:36:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hello.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:36:26,640 --> 00:36:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">Calling for Chan, Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:36:31,160 --> 00:36:32,000
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:34,640
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:36:37,200 --> 00:36:39,520
<font color="#ffffff">He's taking a shower.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:36:39,600 --> 00:36:41,000
<font color="#ffffff">We kind of</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:45,120
<font color="#ffffff">got carried away while having fun earlier.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:36:48,240 --> 00:36:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want to leave a message?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:52,520
<font color="#ffffff">I can pass it along.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:36:52,600 --> 00:36:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">Besides, tonight,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:36:55,200 --> 00:36:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">he's staying over with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:03,160
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:37:03,240 --> 00:37:04,880
<font color="#ffffff">That's all then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">I shouldn't have called.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:37:59,880 --> 00:38:01,440
<font color="#ffffff">Do you still have a headache?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:05,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm still a bit dizzy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:38:08,040 --> 00:38:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">Shouldn't you see a doctor?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:38:10,640 --> 00:38:11,480
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:38:12,120 --> 00:38:14,080
<font color="#ffffff">I feel better already.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:38:15,560 --> 00:38:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:38:18,240 --> 00:38:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">Just having you here is enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:38:27,040 --> 00:38:28,560
<font color="#ffffff">All right then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:32,080
<font color="#ffffff">Take your medicine and get some rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

421
00:38:34,240 --> 00:38:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:39:15,040 --> 00:39:16,200
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:39:19,200 --> 00:39:20,920
<font color="#ffffff">What is this document?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

424
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's an old case file, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:26,400
<font color="#ffffff">An old case?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you taking it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:39:28,440 --> 00:39:30,680
<font color="#ffffff">Well, I'm taking it to…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:39:32,320 --> 00:39:33,880
<font color="#ffffff">I asked where.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:39:35,680 --> 00:39:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">Speak up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:39:38,440 --> 00:39:40,800
<font color="#ffffff">I told Sergeant Lerm to get it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:47,920
<font color="#ffffff">What do you need it for, Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:50,440
<font color="#ffffff">That's Sergeant Padej's file.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">You weren't even on that case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">So what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:39:56,800 --> 00:39:58,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm reviewing old cases</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:39:58,960 --> 00:40:02,040
<font color="#ffffff">to help with my current investigation.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:40:02,120 --> 00:40:03,600
<font color="#ffffff">Any problem with that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">No, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:40:09,680 --> 00:40:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:40:11,520 --> 00:40:12,960
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse us, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">Glad you stepped in, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:39,480
<font color="#ffffff">Right now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:40:39,560 --> 00:40:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant Ae is definitely on to us now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:44,120
<font color="#ffffff">Captain,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:40:44,200 --> 00:40:45,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:40:49,200 --> 00:40:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">Just be careful from now on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:40:52,480 --> 00:40:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir. Here you go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">ROBBERY CASE OF SGT. PADEJ SAKSUEA</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">BY POL. CAPT. CHANSUEK SAMANYA<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

449
00:41:00,520 --> 00:41:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">By the way, Captain…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

450
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you reviewing</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej's case?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

451
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Kan took the file</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on Luang Pho Suea's diamond case?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

452
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:29,440
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:41:29,520 --> 00:41:32,440
<font color="#ffffff">He linked Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to the diamond case,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

454
00:41:32,520 --> 00:41:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">so he wanted to review old files.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:42,800
<font color="#ffffff">What is he up to?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:41:45,160 --> 00:41:46,640
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:41:47,200 --> 00:41:49,080
<font color="#ffffff">I made sure all those documents</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:41:50,240 --> 00:41:52,840
<font color="#ffffff">were buried back then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:41:54,520 --> 00:41:55,360
<font color="#ffffff">I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:57,880
<font color="#ffffff">But something feels off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:41:59,960 --> 00:42:01,200
<font color="#ffffff">If it bothers you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:42:02,160 --> 00:42:05,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'll keep a close eye</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on Captain Kan myself.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

463
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">Good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">CHATCHAWAN</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">PRIVATE DETECTIVE AGENCY<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

465
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:43:10,000 --> 00:43:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">Who is this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:43:11,480 --> 00:43:13,240
<font color="#ffffff">You're calling this early.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:43:14,520 --> 00:43:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">Seriously?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:43:15,920 --> 00:43:18,200
<font color="#ffffff">Early? It's nine in the morning.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">Aren't you awake yet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:43:24,120 --> 00:43:25,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Hello?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:43:25,640 --> 00:43:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:43:29,480 --> 00:43:30,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Hello?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:43:32,800 --> 00:43:34,400
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:43:35,040 --> 00:43:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, why so cold?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

477
00:43:38,760 --> 00:43:40,720
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't get enough sleep, or--</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:43:41,440 --> 00:43:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">Just get to the point, or I'm hanging up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:43:44,840 --> 00:43:46,080
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:43:47,160 --> 00:43:48,360
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:43:49,840 --> 00:43:51,160
<font color="#ffffff">Are you mad at me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:43:53,560 --> 00:43:54,800
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:43:56,120 --> 00:43:58,760
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Just hurry up and say it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

484
00:43:58,840 --> 00:44:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Well,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:44:00,360 --> 00:44:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">today…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:44:02,200 --> 00:44:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">-I want to--</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

487
00:44:03,680 --> 00:44:05,560
<font color="#ffffff">You're already awake, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:44:05,640 --> 00:44:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:44:10,400 --> 00:44:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">That's it, then. I'm busy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

490
00:44:12,560 --> 00:44:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">Hello? Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:44:20,120 --> 00:44:21,360
<font color="#ffffff">Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:44:21,440 --> 00:44:24,080
<font color="#ffffff">Hello? What's wrong with her?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:44:25,200 --> 00:44:26,880
<font color="#ffffff">Who was that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:44:29,440 --> 00:44:32,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's Noona. I was going</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to ask her something.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

495
00:44:33,720 --> 00:44:36,760
<font color="#ffffff">You can talk to me about anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:44:36,840 --> 00:44:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">No need to bother her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

497
00:44:41,080 --> 00:44:42,400
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:44:45,040 --> 00:44:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">Who's here so early?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:44:47,480 --> 00:44:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">Probably Deputy Papon's men.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:44:49,280 --> 00:44:50,520
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:44:52,760 --> 00:44:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">I called Deputy Papon about your safety.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:44:56,080 --> 00:44:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">You did what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:44:58,120 --> 00:45:00,400
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon will send security officers</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

504
00:45:00,480 --> 00:45:02,440
<font color="#ffffff">for you starting today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:45:03,600 --> 00:45:05,000
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, really?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

506
00:45:05,680 --> 00:45:08,840
<font color="#ffffff">You really didn't need to trouble him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

507
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">He needs to ensure your safety.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

508
00:45:12,600 --> 00:45:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">He's the one who dragged you into this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

509
00:45:18,520 --> 00:45:20,080
<font color="#ffffff">True,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

510
00:45:21,200 --> 00:45:24,720
<font color="#ffffff">but no one can protect me better than you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:45:29,400 --> 00:45:30,880
<font color="#ffffff">Da,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:45:30,960 --> 00:45:33,160
<font color="#ffffff">I can't stay by your side forever.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:45:33,840 --> 00:45:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">Don't forget</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:45:35,680 --> 00:45:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">that I still have</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to investigate the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

515
00:45:41,040 --> 00:45:42,360
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

516
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">We'd better head out.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Don't keep them waiting.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

517
00:45:53,160 --> 00:45:55,000
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

518
00:46:03,960 --> 00:46:05,240
<font color="#ffffff">What was that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

519
00:46:05,320 --> 00:46:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">Why call another woman?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

520
00:46:16,240 --> 00:46:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

521
00:46:25,200 --> 00:46:27,320
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

522
00:46:27,400 --> 00:46:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

523
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:30,720
<font color="#ffffff"><i>turned himself in to the Chief.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

524
00:46:30,800 --> 00:46:31,640
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

525
00:46:31,720 --> 00:46:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks for telling me this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

526
00:46:34,920 --> 00:46:36,320
<font color="#ffffff">Someone came to see you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:46:36,400 --> 00:46:37,680
<font color="#ffffff">Who?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:46:39,600 --> 00:46:40,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

529
00:46:40,720 --> 00:46:43,280
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for the information.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

530
00:46:44,600 --> 00:46:46,200
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

531
00:46:46,280 --> 00:46:47,840
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

532
00:46:47,920 --> 00:46:49,400
<font color="#ffffff">They're not here anymore?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

533
00:46:49,480 --> 00:46:50,520
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

534
00:46:50,600 --> 00:46:53,120
<font color="#ffffff">They came to say goodbye and left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

535
00:46:56,640 --> 00:46:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Junior is back!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

536
00:46:59,000 --> 00:47:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">You must be exhausted.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

537
00:47:00,840 --> 00:47:02,880
<font color="#ffffff">Go get some rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

